# Copy to .env for local dev (never commit the real .env). Everything
# here is opt-in — the pipeline defaults to Kokoro and works with none
# of this set (see README.md).

# --- ElevenLabs (opt-in — only used with --voice=elevenlabs) --------
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Your cloned voice's ID (ElevenLabs dashboard -> Voices). Leave unset
# and a stock ElevenLabs voice is used instead, so a render never hard-
# fails just because a clone doesn't exist yet.
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=

# --- Kokoro sidecar ---------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if `python` on PATH isn't the interpreter Kokoro is
# installed into (e.g. a venv). Leave unset to just use `python`.
# KOKORO_PYTHON=

# --- Pexels (opt-in — real photos on content scenes) -------------------
# Free at pexels.com/api, no card, ~20k requests/month. Leave unset and
# scenes just render without a photo — never blocks or fails a render.
# PEXELS_API_KEY=
